 mosque."],["خَدَمَ فِي الْمَسْجِدِ.","","He served in the mosque."],["رَجَعَ إِلَى الْبَيْتِ.","","He returned to the house."],["خَرَجَتْ مِنَ الْبَيْتِ.","","She left the house."],["حَضَرَتْ إِلَى الْحَلْقَةِ.","","She came to the study circle."]],"review":false,"items":[{"ar":null,"en":"Where did he go?","ar_q":"إِلَى أَيْنَ ذَهَبَ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["He served","through the door","to the mosque","in the mosque"],"answer":"to the mosque","model":"to the mosque","note":null,"id":"916b8f2f"},{"ar":null,"en":"How did he come in?","ar_q":"كَيْفَ دَخَلَ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["He served","in the mosque","to the mosque","through the door"],"answer":"through the door","model":"through the door","note":null,"id":"080a44d7"},{"ar":null,"en":"Where did he sit?","ar_q":"أَيْنَ جَلَسَ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["He served","through the door","to the study circle","in the mosque"],"answer":"in the mosque","model":"in the mosque","note":null,"id":"53f5d5db"},{"ar":null,"en":"What else did he do in the mosque?","ar_q":"مَاذَا فَعَلَ أَيْضًا فِي الْمَسْجِدِ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["He served","to the mosque","through the door","in the mosque"],"answer":"He served","model":"He served (خَدَمَ).","note":"خَدَمَ","id":"618ff6a0"},{"ar":"رَجَعَ إِلَى الْمَدْرَسَةِ.","en":"True or false?","ar_q":null,"star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","model":"False: line 5 says he returned to the house (الْبَيْتِ).","note":"line 5 says he returned to the house (الْبَيْتِ).","tf":true,"id":"6c908e01"},{"ar":null,"en":"Who left the house, a man or a woman? How do you know?","ar_q":"مَنْ خَرَجَ مِنَ الْبَيْتِ، رَجُلٌ أَمِ امْرَأَةٌ؟ كَيْفَ عَرَفْتَ؟","star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["He served","A woman: the verb خَرَجَتْ ends in ـَتْ","حَضَرَتْ","to the mosque"],"answer":"A woman: the verb خَرَجَتْ ends in ـَتْ","model":"A woman: the verb خَرَجَتْ ends in ـَتْ (she).","note":"she","id